WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.628 --> 00:00:06.799
Don't tell me you were actually starting
to become friends with that panda.

2
00:00:06.799 --> 00:00:09.426
What? No. It's-It's just--

3
00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:13.180
When we want something, we must use
whatever is at our disposal to get it.

4
00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:16.433
That's all that panda was,
something to use.

5
00:00:18.102 --> 00:00:22.815
Is that why you took me in?
So I could help you get what you wanted?

6
00:00:22.815 --> 00:00:24.233
Zhen.

7
00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:28.696
I took you in because you were clever
and ruthless and unsentimental,

8
00:00:28.696 --> 00:00:29.780
like me.

9
00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:32.158
And the day you stop being those things

10
00:00:32.158 --> 00:00:36.537
is the day when, yes,
you stop being useful to me.

11
00:00:36.537 --> 00:00:40.124
So for both of our sakes,
don't change.

12
00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:52.261
Tonight, when the blood moon rises
to its highest point in the night sky,

13
00:00:52.261 --> 00:00:58.184
I will open the door to the Spirit Realm,
and all of its secrets will be mine!

14
00:01:04.398 --> 00:01:06.692
Does the blood moon
always rise this slowly?

15
00:01:08.777 --> 00:01:11.197
I seem to remember it rising faster.

16
00:01:12.907 --> 00:01:14.200
No?

17
00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:15.284
Just me?

18
00:01:16.452 --> 00:01:17.453
Hmm.

19
00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:20.748
Ugh.

20
00:01:20.748 --> 00:01:22.917
It's just for dramatic effect anyway.

21
00:01:22.917 --> 00:01:25.878
I think I'm just gonna
open the Spirit Realm now.

22
00:01:37.848 --> 00:01:39.517
Bring me Tai Lung!

23
00:01:49.777 --> 00:01:50.778
Tai Lung.

24
00:01:51.862 --> 00:01:52.863
Big fan.

25
00:01:52.863 --> 00:01:55.741
Who are you,
and what are you doing with that staff?

26
00:01:55.741 --> 00:01:58.869
This was given to me
by an old friend of yours.

27
00:01:58.869 --> 00:02:00.371
The puffy panda?

28
00:02:00.371 --> 00:02:01.831
Po might be an idiot,

29
00:02:01.831 --> 00:02:05.793
but he'd never willingly hand over
Oogway's staff to the likes of you.

30
00:02:05.793 --> 00:02:08.170
Who said anything about willingly?

31
00:02:17.054 --> 00:02:21.433
Hmm. Apparently I misjudged you, lizard.

32
00:02:21.433 --> 00:02:23.936
Now, why have you brought me back?

33
00:02:23.936 --> 00:02:26.105
I summoned you here
so that you could teach me

34
00:02:26.105 --> 00:02:28.190
your most legendary kung fu moves.

35
00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:31.318
I don't share my skills with anyone.

36
00:02:31.318 --> 00:02:33.028
It wasn't a request.

37
00:03:24.079 --> 00:03:26.081
Yes, I got it!

38
00:03:26.081 --> 00:03:28.167
The Tai Lung nerve strike.

39
00:03:28.167 --> 00:03:30.336
The power, the precision.

40
00:03:34.006 --> 00:03:36.217
What have you done to me?

41
00:03:36.217 --> 00:03:39.803
All of your kung fu is now mine.

42
00:03:40.721 --> 00:03:45.184
And the best part is,
I'm just getting warmed up.

43
00:03:45.184 --> 00:03:47.561
Bring me General Kai.

44
00:03:50.147 --> 00:03:53.901
Bring me Master Osprey.

45
00:03:55.945 --> 00:03:58.155
Master Bull.

46
00:04:04.829 --> 00:04:05.913
Po, wait!

47
00:04:05.913 --> 00:04:08.207
Please be reasonable.

48
00:04:08.207 --> 00:04:10.417
I'm not going anywhere
until I get my staff back.

49
00:04:10.417 --> 00:04:12.503
No staff is worth your life.

50
00:04:12.503 --> 00:04:14.922
As long as I'm still the Dragon Warrior,

51
00:04:14.922 --> 00:04:17.550
I won't let anyone else get hurt
because of me.

52
00:04:34.483 --> 00:04:35.442
Po!

53
00:04:36.402 --> 00:04:37.528
You're alive!

54
00:04:40.489 --> 00:04:42.658
Please. I made a mistake.

55
00:04:42.658 --> 00:04:45.536
So did I. Trusting you.

56
00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:47.079
I'm sorry.

57
00:04:47.663 --> 00:04:49.498
Did your master tell you
to say that too?

58
00:04:49.498 --> 00:04:52.710
She's not my master.
I'm leaving, for good.

59
00:04:53.544 --> 00:04:54.837
It's the truth.

60
00:04:54.837 --> 00:04:56.922
I was wrong about everything.

61
00:04:58.215 --> 00:05:00.634
- What are you doing?

62
00:05:00.634 --> 00:05:02.261
Stopping you.

63
00:05:02.261 --> 00:05:04.138
Get out of my way, Zhen.

64
00:05:04.138 --> 00:05:05.389
No.

65
00:05:06.182 --> 00:05:07.099
Move.

66
00:05:07.099 --> 00:05:08.851
You want me to move?

67
00:05:08.851 --> 00:05:10.144
Move me.

68
00:05:10.144 --> 00:05:12.730
First you betray me,
and now you wanna fight me?

69
00:05:13.856 --> 00:05:15.316
- Why are you doing this?

70
00:05:15.316 --> 00:05:18.319
To stop you from getting killed.

71
00:05:46.347 --> 00:05:48.516
What do you care
if I get killed or not?

72
00:06:04.365 --> 00:06:05.991
Please, Po.

73
00:06:05.991 --> 00:06:08.202
Just let me do one thing right.

74
00:06:13.374 --> 00:06:16.210
You're not the only one
who's made some bad choices lately.

75
00:06:18.212 --> 00:06:20.339
You're really gonna
go through with this, aren't you?

76
00:06:20.339 --> 00:06:21.465
'Fraid so.

77
00:06:21.465 --> 00:06:24.385
And there's nothing I can do
to talk you out of it?

78
00:06:24.385 --> 00:06:25.553
I'm afraid not.

79
00:06:25.553 --> 00:06:27.555
You can't beat her, you know.

80
00:06:27.555 --> 00:06:29.139
You're probably right.

81
00:06:30.599 --> 00:06:32.017
But I have to try.

82
00:06:33.644 --> 00:06:35.604
Get as far away from this place
as you can.

83
00:06:35.604 --> 00:06:36.689
Po!

84
00:06:36.689 --> 00:06:38.899
We should never have
let him come here.

85
00:06:38.899 --> 00:06:41.152
We are such terrible fathers.

86
00:06:41.152 --> 00:06:43.070
At least you didn't lie and betray him.

87
00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:45.489
Well, that's true.
You're worse.

88
00:06:45.489 --> 00:06:47.408
I am a terrible friend.

89
00:06:47.408 --> 00:06:50.119
"Friend"?
That feels a little generous, no?

90
00:06:50.119 --> 00:06:52.329
Uh, l-let's just give up.
Surrender.

91
00:06:52.329 --> 00:06:53.998
We can't let him go in there alone.

92
00:06:53.998 --> 00:06:55.583
What can we do?

93
00:06:55.583 --> 00:06:58.043
There are just three of us
against an army.

94
00:06:58.043 --> 00:07:00.838
Then I guess we'll just have to
get an army of our own.

95
00:07:13.851 --> 00:07:15.728
Hey! Listen up, everybody!

96
00:07:19.523 --> 00:07:22.151
Quack!

97
00:07:24.528 --> 00:07:25.779
Thank you.

98
00:07:25.779 --> 00:07:27.865
The Dragon Warrior's in trouble.

99
00:07:28.782 --> 00:07:30.868
- Who?
- You know, Po.

100
00:07:32.328 --> 00:07:33.496
The panda.

101
00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:38.626
No, no. A different panda.

102
00:07:38.626 --> 00:07:40.836
- I'm his father.
- I'm also his father.

103
00:07:41.587 --> 00:07:42.755
Okay, that doesn't matter.

104
00:07:42.755 --> 00:07:46.425
What matters is that my friend's
in trouble and he needs my help.

105
00:07:46.425 --> 00:07:48.385
So, I need yours.

106
00:07:48.385 --> 00:07:50.221
Why should we help you?

107
00:07:50.221 --> 00:07:51.555
Because--

108
00:07:51.555 --> 00:07:52.640
Because...

109
00:07:53.516 --> 00:07:55.059
it's the right thing to do.

110
00:07:59.396 --> 00:08:01.357
Stop it. Stop.

111
00:08:01.357 --> 00:08:02.691
Stop laughing.

112
00:08:03.984 --> 00:08:06.320
Look, I know you think
it might be too late

113
00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:11.075
for a bunch of cheats, thieves and
cutthroats like us to change our ways,

114
00:08:11.075 --> 00:08:16.162
but a good friend once told me
it's never too late to do the right thing.

115
00:08:16.162 --> 00:08:19.707
So what you're saying is,
the more right we do now,

116
00:08:19.707 --> 00:08:21.751
the more wrong we can do later.

117
00:08:21.751 --> 00:08:22.961
- What? No.

118
00:08:22.961 --> 00:08:25.506
And with The Chameleon out of the way...

119
00:08:25.506 --> 00:08:27.716
We can finally do all the wrong we want.

120
00:08:27.716 --> 00:08:29.760
I-I think you're missing
the fundamental point.

121
00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:32.388
- Violence, violence, violence.

122
00:08:32.388 --> 00:08:36.225
Are you guys ready to do the right thing
for the wrong reasons?

123
00:08:41.272 --> 00:08:43.816
Now, you see, this mistake
this Dragon Warrior fellow made

124
00:08:43.816 --> 00:08:45.609
was underestimating his opponent.

125
00:08:45.609 --> 00:08:48.571
I never would have walked
into such an obvious trap.

126
00:08:48.571 --> 00:08:50.072
- Hey.

127
00:08:52.658 --> 00:08:55.327
Now, you see, the mistake
this Dragon Warrior fellow made was that--

128
00:08:55.327 --> 00:08:56.996
Shut up, Larry.

129
00:09:01.667 --> 00:09:04.044
This place is crawling
with more guards than I've ever seen.

130
00:09:04.044 --> 00:09:06.130
I'm never gonna get to Po in time.

131
00:09:06.130 --> 00:09:08.924
You just get to Po.
We'll take care of the guards.

132
00:09:08.924 --> 00:09:10.301
We will?

133
00:09:10.301 --> 00:09:11.801
I-I mean, we will.

134
00:09:11.801 --> 00:09:13.012
But how?

135
00:09:13.512 --> 00:09:15.180
Just leave that to me.

136
00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:47.880
General Kai?

137
00:09:48.631 --> 00:09:49.881
Lord Shen?

138
00:09:49.881 --> 00:09:53.844
Those are all my old nemesis-es.
Nemes-ee. Nemes-i?

139
00:09:53.844 --> 00:09:56.889
The Chameleon is pulling spirits
from the Spirit Realm

140
00:09:56.889 --> 00:09:58.933
and draining us of all our moves.

141
00:09:58.933 --> 00:10:01.769
And she's using your staff to do it.

142
00:10:01.769 --> 00:10:03.771
- I'm here to get it back.

143
00:10:03.771 --> 00:10:05.272
I won't hold my breath.

144
00:10:05.272 --> 00:10:06.816
Um, I'm sorry, do I know you?

145
00:10:06.816 --> 00:10:08.609
Do you know me? It's Scott.

146
00:10:10.402 --> 00:10:12.363
The fire-breathing crocodile?

147
00:10:12.363 --> 00:10:15.449
Oh, right! Scott!

148
00:10:15.449 --> 00:10:17.743
Master Shifu and I
were just talking about you.

149
00:10:17.743 --> 00:10:19.203
Panda.

150
00:10:19.829 --> 00:10:23.582
Oogway made a mistake
choosing you as the Dragon Warrior.

151
00:10:24.708 --> 00:10:28.838
I just didn't realize
how big a mistake it was until now.

152
00:10:28.838 --> 00:10:31.382
Whoa. Tai Lung?

153
00:10:31.382 --> 00:10:34.927
I'm gonna get that staff back,
restore your kung fu,

154
00:10:34.927 --> 00:10:37.388
and return you all
back to the Spirit Realm.

155
00:10:37.388 --> 00:10:38.722
You'll see.

156
00:10:38.722 --> 00:10:40.057
All I see

157
00:10:40.891 --> 00:10:42.810
is a broken promise.

158
00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:52.444
All right, you bunch of
cantankerous Komodos.

159
00:10:52.444 --> 00:10:55.739
Now, this can go one of two ways.

160
00:10:55.739 --> 00:10:59.535
The easy way,
in which you surrender willingly,

161
00:10:59.535 --> 00:11:03.664
or the hard way,
where you surrender woundedly.

162
00:11:03.664 --> 00:11:06.458
The choice is yours.

163
00:11:09.795 --> 00:11:12.715
- I was kidding! I was kidding!

164
00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:22.641
Aw.

165
00:11:24.852 --> 00:11:26.395
- Ow! Ow!

166
00:11:28.731 --> 00:11:29.732
Thanks, Ping.

167
00:11:34.069 --> 00:11:35.196
Run away!

168
00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:42.286
- Cannonball!

169
00:11:50.753 --> 00:11:51.962
- Oh, is it too spicy?

170
00:11:51.962 --> 00:11:54.715
Mmm. No. It's got the perfect kick.

171
00:11:54.715 --> 00:11:57.968
Ginseng. That's the secret
to my mulberry punch.

172
00:12:04.934 --> 00:12:08.187
That panda was right.
More violence later is better!

173
00:12:08.812 --> 00:12:10.147
- Yay!

174
00:12:16.111 --> 00:12:18.697
I believe you have something
that belongs to me.

175
00:12:22.076 --> 00:12:24.245
Can't you even die right?

176
00:12:24.245 --> 00:12:26.205
Can't you even kill wrong?

177
00:12:26.205 --> 00:12:28.541
No.
Wordplay didn't come together.

178
00:12:28.541 --> 00:12:29.875
Now, about that staff...

179
00:12:32.253 --> 00:12:33.254
Take it.

180
00:12:33.254 --> 00:12:35.923
I already have everything I need
from it anyway.

181
00:12:36.507 --> 00:12:38.717
I think this was destiny.

182
00:12:38.717 --> 00:12:43.222
A final face-off
between formidable adversaries,

183
00:12:43.222 --> 00:12:46.058
alike in so many ways.

184
00:12:46.058 --> 00:12:47.685
If only I had a dumpling for every time

185
00:12:47.685 --> 00:12:49.603
a villain told me
how much we had in common.

186
00:12:49.603 --> 00:12:50.688
It's true.

187
00:12:50.688 --> 00:12:53.023
We've both risen
to the highest of heights.

188
00:12:53.023 --> 00:12:56.152
It's a shame only one of us can
come out on top.

189
00:12:56.152 --> 00:12:58.779
It is a shame, for you.

190
00:12:58.779 --> 00:13:03.742
My combined powers of sorcery and kung fu
make me unstoppable.

191
00:13:03.742 --> 00:13:08.205
And once I dispense with you,
I'll expand my rule from Juniper City to--

192
00:13:08.205 --> 00:13:09.999
Every other city and town and village

193
00:13:09.999 --> 00:13:11.750
from here to the Valley of Peace
and beyond.

194
00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:12.960
Yeah, I know.

195
00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:15.045
But how did you know?

196
00:13:15.045 --> 00:13:19.008
I saw it in a vision
because I'm the Dragon Warrior...

197
00:13:21.177 --> 00:13:22.511
for now at least.

198
00:13:22.511 --> 00:13:26.098
But I've realized
that it's probably time I made a change.

199
00:13:27.183 --> 00:13:28.601
And so should you.

200
00:13:28.601 --> 00:13:31.478
I'm The Chameleon.
I do nothing but change.

201
00:13:31.478 --> 00:13:33.314
Only on the outside.

202
00:13:33.314 --> 00:13:36.066
Real change happens from within.

203
00:13:36.066 --> 00:13:38.527
And if we're really as alike as you say,

204
00:13:38.527 --> 00:13:40.571
then maybe we could both let go
of who we were

205
00:13:40.571 --> 00:13:42.990
and become something better
than we already are.

206
00:13:43.782 --> 00:13:46.285
- What do you say?
- I say...

207
00:13:48.871 --> 00:13:50.372
Well, I saw that coming.

208
00:13:52.666 --> 00:13:54.376
We're very proud of you.

209
00:13:54.376 --> 00:13:55.586
You tried it our way.

210
00:13:55.586 --> 00:13:57.713
Now try it yours.

211
00:13:57.713 --> 00:13:59.965
Kick her butt.

212
00:13:59.965 --> 00:14:01.884
I'm way ahead of you.

213
00:14:09.934 --> 00:14:12.102
Master Elephant's Trunk Twist.

214
00:14:15.481 --> 00:14:17.399
Master Boar's Tusks of Terror.

215
00:14:18.484 --> 00:14:20.486
Master Wolf's Fangs of Fury.

216
00:14:25.533 --> 00:14:27.493
Master Bull's Horns of Doom.

217
00:14:29.912 --> 00:14:31.121
What?

218
00:14:31.121 --> 00:14:32.456
Recognize this move?

219
00:14:35.084 --> 00:14:37.795
Is that how I sound?
I don't sound like that, do I?

220
00:14:37.795 --> 00:14:41.048
You didn't earn those skills.
You just stole them!

221
00:14:42.132 --> 00:14:43.717
Give him a left, a right, uppercut.

222
00:14:43.717 --> 00:14:47.304
- Which one are you rooting for?
- I'm not sure. This is all very confusing.

223
00:14:47.304 --> 00:14:50.057
I'm stronger than every opponent
you've ever faced,

224
00:14:50.057 --> 00:14:53.477
because I am every opponent
you've ever faced.

225
00:14:53.477 --> 00:14:54.395
Po!

226
00:15:07.032 --> 00:15:09.827
Whoa. I gotta workshop
those heroic entrances.

227
00:15:09.827 --> 00:15:12.121
Nah, it was just right.

228
00:15:13.956 --> 00:15:17.293
I knew I should have left you
to rot in the gutter where you belong.

229
00:15:17.293 --> 00:15:19.920
Better to rot in the gutter
than under your thumb.

230
00:15:28.012 --> 00:15:29.930
- Two against one?

231
00:15:29.930 --> 00:15:32.141
Well, now, that doesn't seem fair.

232
00:15:32.141 --> 00:15:34.310
I'll have to even the odds.

233
00:15:35.519 --> 00:15:37.188
Master Cobra.

234
00:15:37.855 --> 00:15:39.940
Master Osprey.

235
00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:41.984
Master Scorpion.

236
00:15:41.984 --> 00:15:44.028
Master Wolf.

237
00:15:44.028 --> 00:15:46.489
General Kai.

238
00:15:46.489 --> 00:15:47.781
Lord Shen.

239
00:15:51.994 --> 00:15:55.039
That is awesome!

240
00:15:56.165 --> 00:15:58.167
I mean, it's disturbing, but it's awesome.

241
00:16:15.559 --> 00:16:16.393
Whoa!

242
00:16:17.311 --> 00:16:18.812
Zhen!

243
00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:33.244
No!

244
00:16:39.667 --> 00:16:40.918
Whoa, whoa!

245
00:16:53.472 --> 00:16:54.723
Po!

246
00:17:01.564 --> 00:17:03.232
I thought we were friends.

247
00:17:05.109 --> 00:17:06.193
Stand back.

248
00:17:06.193 --> 00:17:08.529
I'm gonna kick my butt.

249
00:18:31.278 --> 00:18:32.571
Come on, Po, get out of there.

250
00:18:32.571 --> 00:18:35.032
- You have to do this.
- I can't beat The Chameleon.

251
00:18:35.032 --> 00:18:36.659
A wise, old tortoise once told me

252
00:18:36.659 --> 00:18:38.911
that you never know what you can do
until you do it.

253
00:18:38.911 --> 00:18:41.080
The fate of the world
hangs in the balance,

254
00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:43.666
and you're here giving me life advice
from a tortoise?

255
00:18:43.666 --> 00:18:45.251
Be the pit, Zhen.

256
00:18:45.876 --> 00:18:47.586
Be the pit.

257
00:18:57.346 --> 00:18:59.014
And what do you think you're doing?

258
00:18:59.014 --> 00:19:00.766
Finishing what Po started.

259
00:19:00.766 --> 00:19:03.644
Oh, please. How many times
do I have to tell you?

260
00:19:05.646 --> 00:19:07.064
Don't slouch.

261
00:19:17.074 --> 00:19:19.368
You ungrateful little urchin.

262
00:19:19.368 --> 00:19:23.539
After all I've done for you,
you betrayed me for the panda?

263
00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:28.294
First rule
of the streets: Never trust anyone.

264
00:19:28.294 --> 00:19:31.714
Ha! You can't defeat me.
I know all your moves.

265
00:19:31.714 --> 00:19:33.299
Not this one.

266
00:19:33.299 --> 00:19:36.927
Roll, stir, serve,

267
00:19:36.927 --> 00:19:39.054
and ska-blam!

268
00:19:43.767 --> 00:19:46.645
- Yes!

269
00:19:46.645 --> 00:19:49.940
Second rule: Someone always gets hurt.

270
00:19:50.566 --> 00:19:52.193
Now, that's a cool move.

271
00:19:52.193 --> 00:19:55.029
Po! You could have gotten out of that cage
anytime you wanted?

272
00:19:55.029 --> 00:19:56.197
You faker.

273
00:19:56.197 --> 00:19:58.282
It's not faking. It's Method.

274
00:19:58.282 --> 00:20:01.494
Besides, how's a peach pit
ever supposed to become a tree

275
00:20:01.494 --> 00:20:04.288
if you never give it
the chance to grow?

276
00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:09.376
And, hey, you stirred faster
and rolled higher.

277
00:20:09.376 --> 00:20:12.379
But for the last time, the word is...

278
00:20:19.512 --> 00:20:20.638
..."skadoosh."

279
00:20:46.413 --> 00:20:49.124
Maybe Oogway was right about you.

280
00:20:51.877 --> 00:20:54.213
You aren't completely useless after all.

281
00:20:55.089 --> 00:20:56.632
Oh, my gosh.
Thank you so much.

282
00:21:07.059 --> 00:21:09.520
That's my son.

283
00:21:09.520 --> 00:21:10.688
Our son.

284
00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:15.901
I think it's time you send us home, panda.

285
00:21:50.311 --> 00:21:52.688
Zhen, do something!

286
00:21:52.688 --> 00:21:56.484
Third rule:
No one's interested in your feelings.

287
00:22:01.572 --> 00:22:05.576
See you on the other side, Dragon Warrior.

288
00:22:28.057 --> 00:22:30.226
We packed some food
for your time in jail.

289
00:22:30.226 --> 00:22:33.020
Let's hope it's not
your final meal.

290
00:22:33.020 --> 00:22:34.563
Thanks, guys.

291
00:22:35.439 --> 00:22:40.152
I was thinking, after I serve my time
and I'm a free fox again,

292
00:22:40.152 --> 00:22:42.988
maybe I'll open one of those
acupuncture places that are all the rage.

293
00:22:42.988 --> 00:22:47.827
I think you're better suited for a job
with a little more room for growth.

294
00:22:51.664 --> 00:22:52.665
Jade Palace?

295
00:22:54.500 --> 00:22:56.252
Her?

296
00:22:56.252 --> 00:23:00.130
Out of all the candidates you choose
to train as your worthy successor,

297
00:23:00.130 --> 00:23:01.841
